# The certificate format, mirrored byte-identical in the public Project-Foundry
# and the private Private-Foundry. A circuit the Private Foundry mints hashes to
# exactly what a public reviewer recomputes from the published bundle. Content is
# LF-normalized before hashing so both repos agree regardless of CRLF handling.
# Drift is detectable by comparing this one file across the two repos.
# Regenerate with tools/gen_checksums.sh; update both repos in one change.
